  "title": "Embrace Future Growth",
  "description": "When planning for the future: - Acknowledge change: Remind yourself, \"I will grow and change in ways I can’t predict.\" - Set flexible goals: Make plans that can adapt to future versions of yourself. - Reflect on past growth: Look at how much you’ve changed in the last five years as proof that growth is constant. Example: Five years ago, you might have had different priorities. Imagine how today’s plans could evolve just as much.",
